<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Humana raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Humana raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Humana Inc to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said kept the long-term rating as buy.</p>
<p>-- Earlier on Tuesday, Humana said it signed a definitive agreement to buy Physician Corp of America for a total of about $400 million in cash and debt.  Humana said the proposed deal is expected to be accretive to fiscal 1998 earnings.</p>
<p>-- Humana gained 5/8 to 23-7/8.</p>
